# Event Planner Website

A simple event planning website made with **HTML, CSS and JavaScript**.
No frameworks, no backend server - everything runs in the browser.
Data is saved using `localStorage` so it stays even after closing the browser.

---

## How to Run

Just open `index.html` in any browser (Chrome, Firefox, Edge). That's it!

---

## Files

| File         | What it does |
|--------------|--------------|
| `index.html` | The structure of the website (all the sections, forms, tables, buttons) |
| `style.css`  | How the website looks (colors, layout, fonts, spacing) |
| `script.js`  | How the website works (login, creating events, registering, etc.) |

